<li><p>Write your work in a neat and organized format and <alert>fully justify every step</alert>. An answer without supporting work may receive little or no credit.</p></li>
<li><p>Give exact answers. Decimal approximations are not required.</p></li>
<li><p>If you need more room, use the blank page at the end of the booklet and say so on the page of the problem.</p></li>
<li><p>The last page of the booklet is a formula sheet.</p></li>
